 align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">1.36 (0.74&#x02013;2.53)</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1"/></tr></tbody></table><table-wrap-foot><fn id="tfn5-ndt-2-227"><label>a</label><p>The independent variables in the model are adjusted for each other. Model fit summary: deviance = 235.33, likelihood ratio test = 41.93, df = 7, p &#x0003c; 0.001.</p></fn><fn id="tfn6-ndt-2-227"><label>b</label><p>Adjusted p values for likelihood ratio statistics.</p></fn><fn id="tfn7-ndt-2-227"><p><bold>Abbreviations:</bold> <italic>APOE</italic>, apolipoprotein E; CI, confidence interval; <italic>COMT</italic>, catechol-O-methyltransferase; OR, odds ratio.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></floats-wrap></article>